              <h2>Custom Trim Work for Every Room</h2>
              <p>Trim work can enhance various areas of a home, from living rooms and kitchens to bedrooms and mudrooms. Adding mudroom cabinetry with decorative trim, for example, combines style and functionality for organized storage solutions.</p>
              <ul class="post-list">
                <li><strong>Kitchens:</strong> Custom kitchen cabinetry with detailed trim work adds elegance and character. Premium kitchen cabinets featuring crown molding or intricate designs enhance the overall aesthetic appeal of the space.</li>
                <li><strong>Living Rooms:</strong> Wall paneling installation, crown molding, and decorative ceiling beams can transform a plain living space into a luxurious setting.</li>
                <li><strong>Bedrooms:</strong> Baseboards, casings, and even custom headboard wall paneling can add a refined touch to bedroom decor.</li>
                <li><strong>Mudrooms:</strong> Mudroom storage cabinets with trim details improve both organization and visual appeal, making daily routines more efficient.</li>
                <li><strong>Offices:</strong> Office cabinets with elegant trim provide a polished, professional look while improving storage solutions.</li>
              </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="post-body__section reveal">
              <h2>Trends in Modern Trim Carpentry</h2>
              <p>While traditional designs remain popular, modern trends in 2026 have introduced fresh perspectives on trim carpentry:</p>
              <ul class="post-list">
                <li><strong>Minimalist Trim:</strong> Slimmer, more understated trims create a clean, contemporary aesthetic.</li>
                <li><strong>Contrasting Colors:</strong> Dark trim against light-colored walls (or vice versa) adds striking visual contrast.</li>
                <li><strong>Custom Designs:</strong> Homeowners are increasingly opting for unique patterns and styles that reflect personal tastes.</li>
                <li><strong>Reclaimed Wood Trim:</strong> Sustainable and rustic, reclaimed wood trim adds character and warmth to a space.</li>
              </ul>
