              <p>When choosing materials, consider options like wood, MDF, or PVC, each offering distinct advantages in terms of cost, durability, and appearance. Wood provides a rich, traditional feel, while MDF is budget-friendly and smooth. PVC is excellent for high-moisture areas such as bathrooms or kitchens.</p>
